   {
    "type": "text",
    "tex": "結合エネルギー（kJ/mol）を H−H 436，Cl−Cl 243，H−Cl 432 として，$\\ce{H2 + Cl2 -> 2HCl}$ の反応エンタルピーを求めよ．"
   }
  ]
 },
 "figures": [],
 "answer": {
  "parts": [
   {
    "id": "main",
    "tex": "$-185\\,\\mathrm{kJ}$",
    "grading": "約{-185|3} [kJ]"
   }
  ]
 },
 "solutions": [
  {
   "id": "main",
   "kind": "main",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "tex": "切る結合 $436+243=679$（吸収），できる結合 $2\\times432=864$（放出）．$\\Delta H=679-864=-185\\,\\mathrm{kJ}$（発熱）．"
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
